oto_h470_w1080/83889441_6_1774341997642-7769_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 4: Buy 1 BHK Flat in Ghatkopar West Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVN99A9ds7-fN3qPNTDJKOoJ8qOffpj/Photo_h470_w1080/83889441_5_1774341883223-7659_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 5: Buy 1 BHK Flat in Ghatkopar West Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVN99A9ds7-fN3qPNTDJKOoJ8qOffpj/Photo_h470_w1080/83889441_3_1774341886180-2568_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 6: Buy 1 BHK Flat in Ghatkopar West Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVN99A9ds7-fN3qPNTDJKOoJ8qOffpj/Photo_h470_w1080/83889441_2_1774341885176-825_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 7: Buy 1 BHK Flat in Ghatkopar West Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVN99A9ds7-fN3qPNTDJKOoJ8qOffpj/Photo_h470_w1080/83889441_7_1774341996958-7688_470_1080.jpg)\n\nPosted: Yesterday\n\n*   [Share Feedback](javascript:void(0))\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Ghatkopar West, Mumbai\n\n[Rockline The Meridian Towers](https://www.magicbricks.com/rockline-the-meridian-towers-ghatkopar-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343136373435)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n473 sqft\n\nStatus\n\nReady to Move\n\nFloor\n\n13 out of 18\n\nTransaction\n\nNew Property\n\nFurnishing\n\nSemi-Furnished\n\nfacing\n\nEast\n\noverlooking\n\nMain Road\n\nSociety\n\nRockline The Meridian Towers\n\nOwnership\n\nFreehold\n\nBathroom\n\n2\n\nBalcony\n\n1\n\n*    Banquet Hall \n*    Health club with Steam / Jaccuzi \n*    Fingerprint Access \n*    Fireplace \n\nEast Facing Property\n\nNewly Constructed Property\n\nAn Elegant 1 BHK flat located in Ghatkopar West, Mumbai is now available for sale.The flat has a prime location within Rockline The Meridian Towers. Located in Ghatkopar West, this ready to move apartment is sold at price of ₹1.02 Cr. This property sits on 13 floor with a total carpet area of 473 sqft. The apa